{"id":"torrey:sealing-of-the-holy-spirit","source":"torrey","name":"Sealing Of The Holy Spirit","slug":"sealing-of-the-holy-spirit","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Christ received — Joh 6:27.","refs":[["John",6,27,6,27]]},{"text":"Saints receive — 2Co 1:22; Eph 1:13.","refs":[["2Cor",1,22,1,22],["Eph",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"Is to the day of redemption — Eph 4:30.","refs":[["Eph",4,30,4,30]]},{"text":"The wicked do not receive — Re 9:4.","refs":[["Rev",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"Judgment suspended until all saints receive — Re 7:3.","refs":[["Rev",7,3,7,3]]},{"text":"Typified — Ro 4:11.","refs":[["Rom",4,11,4,11]]}],"refCount":7}
